    "detailed_description": "If you like to try fresh gameplay, here you can play games made by others, including but not limited to: action, shooting, driving, real-time tactics, chess, party games, etc. You can follow different game authors and put forward your valuable opinions on gameplay.<br />\r\nIf you have your own game ideas but don't know how to write code, here is a set of drag-and-drop scripting languages \u200b\u200bwith the same level of difficulty as children's programming education software. You can write logic through the mouse and mobile phone touch screen. We also provide a complete editor pipeline, including map editor, mechanical editor, terrain editor, UI editor. In terms of learning, we have built-in a basic official tutorial with pictures and texts. As long as you have ideas and a certain logical thinking ability, a person can also make fun games and get income through our in-app purchase system.",
    "about_the_game": "If you like to try fresh gameplay, here you can play games made by others, including but not limited to: action, shooting, driving, real-time tactics, chess, party games, etc. You can follow different game authors and put forward your valuable opinions on gameplay.<br />\r\nIf you have your own game ideas but don't know how to write code, here is a set of drag-and-drop scripting languages \u200b\u200bwith the same level of difficulty as children's programming education software. You can write logic through the mouse and mobile phone touch screen. We also provide a complete editor pipeline, including map editor, mechanical editor, terrain editor, UI editor. In terms of learning, we have built-in a basic official tutorial with pictures and texts. As long as you have ideas and a certain logical thinking ability, a person can also make fun games and get income through our in-app purchase system.",
    "short_description": "A game production platform based on 3D physics engine and building block logic programming. Players who like creating games and assembling machinery can design a rich variety of custom games without having to learn and memorize complex commands and gain profit through the in-app purchase system.",
